# The synthetic smoke corpus is a test fixture, not training data: 10 rows,
# review status `engineering-smoke`, and `hcs-therapy data validate` counts it as
# 0 trainable records. `tests/test_cli.py` asserts exactly that, so the file has
# to be present in a fresh clone.
!datasets/train/seed-smoke.jsonl

